<p>Liposuction, done through different techniques, helps drain excess fat from different areas of the body, including thighs, hips, buttocks, upper arms, abdomen, waist, back, inner knee, calves, chest, and facial regions.</p>
<p>India is the most preferred country for liposuction. And Delhi, the capital city, is where patients across the globe visit for medical and aesthetic treatments.</p>

